cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
title: "Caphlon-Model: A 6.87 GiB lightweight build of Qwen 3.8 27B"
abstract: >-
  A compact GGUF build of Qwen 3.8 27B (6.87 GiB, IQ2_S base) produced by
  vocabulary merge-table reduction and hybrid-interval layer pruning.
  Retains 92.9% of the base model's MMLU score and 96.7% HumanEval pass@1.
